"This button starts browsing the network for nodes on connected LANs. Then it scans each node to find open TCP ports. When needed, press the stop button to cancel this task. Traces panel will provide you with progress information if needed." = "此按钮会开始在已连接的局域网中搜索节点，然后扫描每个节点以查找开放的 TCP 端口。如有需要，可按停止按钮取消此任务。如需了解进度，可查看跟踪面板。";
"This kind of public node on the Internet should only be used for running an ICMP (ping) action, to estimate the network average round trip time (RTT). Other services are not supported by those remote hosts." = "互联网上的这类公共节点只应用于执行 ICMP（ping）操作，以估算网络的平均往返时间（RTT）。这些远程主机不支持其他服务。";
