/* Phrases à trou (%@ = adresse ou nom) */
"Parallel TCP connections will be established to %@ on TCP ports from 1 to 65535, to find open services. The new discovered services will be displayed on the bottom view. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "将在 TCP 端口 1 至 65535 上与 %@ 建立并行 TCP 连接，以查找开放的服务。新发现的服务将显示在下方视图中。按 STOP 按钮可中断此任务。";
"A TCP connection to the Discard port (9/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be sent on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device to this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the outgoing direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "将与 %@ 的 Discard 端口（9/TCP）建立 TCP 连接。随后，本设备将通过此连接以可用的最大吞吐量向该目标主机发送数据，以评估上传方向可达到的最大速度。按 STOP 按钮可中断此任务。";
"A TCP connection to the Chargen port (19/TCP) of %@ will be established. Data will then be received on this connection at the maximum throughput available, by this device from this target host, to evaluate the maximum speed that can be reached in the incoming direction. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "将与 %@ 的 Chargen 端口（19/TCP）建立 TCP 连接。随后，本设备将通过此连接以可用的最大吞吐量从该目标主机接收数据，以评估下载方向可达到的最大速度。按 STOP 按钮可中断此任务。";
"ICMP packets of type ECHO_REQUEST will be sent to %@ at a rate of one packet per second. The target should reply with an ICMP packet of type ECHO_REPLY. The round trip type is computed and displayed on the chart. You can interrupt this task by pressing the STOP button." = "将以每秒一个数据包的速率向 %@ 发送 ECHO_REQUEST 类型的 ICMP 数据包。目标应回复 ECHO_REPLY 类型的 ICMP 数据包。往返时间将被计算并显示在图表上。按 STOP 按钮可中断此任务。";
"found %@" = "已找到 %@";
"trying %@" = "正在尝试 %@";
"retrying %@" = "正在重试 %@";
